  "details": "This is a Idea I had for a long time but never got to express it to anybody or the VRChat team itself. Until I got a reply on my comment on one of the latest VRChat YT Uploads recently.\n\nBut yeah, what does this \"Mutual Friends\" Feature do? Well, to see this feature (if it DOES get added), you would have to go to a friends profile and click Mutual Friends!\n\nThen you will be able to see if your Friend is Friends with any of your Friends on your Friends List!!\n\n(That's a lot of Friends lol).",
